---
layout: base.njk
pageTitle: "Blog | Theo Brucker"
description: "Weekly writing on building and assessing security programs, CMMC and NIST 800-171, security operations, detection engineering, and the tools I build."
permalink: /blog/index.html
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
---

<section id="blog-archive">
  <p class="eyebrow">Blog</p>
  <h1>All posts</h1>
  <p class="lede">Weekly notes on building and assessing security programs, compliance, detection work, and whatever I am building.</p>

  <ul class="post-list">
  {% for post in collections.posts %}
    <li>
      <span class="post-date">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</span>
      <h3><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h3>
      <p>{{ post.data.summary }}</p>
      {% set visibleTags = post.data.tags | reject("equalto", "posts") %}
      {% if visibleTags | length %}<span class="reg-tags" style="justify-content:flex-start">{% for t in visibleTags %}<span class="tag">{{ t }}</span>{% endfor %}</span>{% endif %}
    </li>
  {% endfor %}
  </ul>

  <div class="blog-foot">
    <a href="/feed.xml" class="rss-link">Subscribe via RSS</a>
  </div>
</section>
